Hi everyone,
Kris Wild in my lab had his mind blown when I showed him you can easily switch between R versions in R Studio on a PC. But then he realised that he didn't know about this because it is apparently not an option for mac users. But he found this workaround <https://rud.is/rswitch/>.
All the best,
Mike

